Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||08-18-2000||03:47 AM||||Ok I finally got my car repainted.  It was a garge job by me and my dad so its far from show quality or anything like that.  But I did not have the rear view mirrors sanded down in time (we are on time constriants, I am leaving for school in a couple days) to be painted with the car.  Anywho my question is keep the mirors black to match the trim or go the same color as the car.  We need to go back and touch up some mess ups and areas like the door jambs and stuff.  so they could go yellow then.  Also I really was thinking about doing same color trim also but at the last minute decided not too and I could always take it of scuff em up and paint them.  Anyways I love how the car looks now and just wanted to hear opinions on mirror color<P>thanks,<BR>Dan<P>------------------<BR>86 gt fiero<BR>3.8/4speed auto<BR>ace conversion kit<BR>15" konig monsoon's<BR>rear swaybar/ and urethane on rear.<BR>Soon to come urethane all the way around. and new yellow paint w/ raised spoiler!!!!<BR>(also in way future years forced induction on my 3.8!!!!!!!!!)||||reg||1
